u estava na escada quando eu ouvi o seu grito.","e":"I was on the stairs when I heard your scream.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.862426,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"ee74c18a6bf873ea4fd177af731f2db5","i":"f7aa3488f8e2e99e23aea89fc45357cb","r":"4859610:6390881:385:1958632","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4859610","6390881","385"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Eu ouvi um grito e então uma batida.","e":"I heard a shout and then a crash.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.864226,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"5fca0dbf34e329109f7dc8d50007709e","i":"c16b4c8f2e76cf87210ef0cb6fb96b1d","r":"6554509:682020","c":"heo598","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6554509","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6554509","b":"Tatoeba sentence #6554509 by heo598; English translation #682020 by Source_VOA","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6554509","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Encontrei. Estava na recepção quando ouvi o grito.","e":"Yeah, I was, covering the front desk when I heard the scream.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.753225,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"b493eabd26e3334f54ee36e7bbc85985","i":"4490dc1676f85da72662c6d2a1c238be","r":"5858434:6883922:476 477:4726090","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5858434","6883922","476 477"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Não parece um grito de guerra muito convincente.","e":"That doesn't sound like a very convincing battle cry.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.896333,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"3452d2765b4986ade35c618ff51f331b","i":"53315633e652849a538ddf5fad50516d","r":"5348112:6716144:560:3605919","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5348112","6716144","560"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Se sentires que estás em perigo, dá um grito.","e":"If you feel like you're in trouble, just yell out.","s":"opensu